Title: A sequence pauses and resumes

INT. STUDIO - NIGHT

LENA stands in a ring of light. Behind her, a photograph of MARK, smiling. The HOST circles.

HOST
Forty-five thousand for him, as he stands. Or we play the tape, and the price moves.

LENA
Which way?

HOST
That would be telling.

LENA
Play it.

INT. MARK'S FLAT - DAY - WEEKS EARLIER

Seen through a security camera. MARK shows a ring to his friend BARRY.

BARRY
A fiancée is worth ten times a girlfriend. Propose, get on the show, and cash her in.

MARK
She's not too sweet to sell.

INT. STUDIO - NIGHT

The tape freezes on Mark's grin. Lena has not moved.

HOST
Shall we see what he's worth now?

The number behind her falls, and keeps falling.
